  _subtitle: Chapters 15 and 16
  _description: 'Back in the [[81773492-1f02-4ad4-9a99-9d831db56088|Emerald City]],
    the Wizard turns out to be a humbug. He keeps his promises anyway: [[7d0c4945-95e4-406c-bb58-b25ba6010a16|Brains]],
    a [[71e383ad-fffe-42ca-87c1-854ac54bb4bf|Heart]] and [[e68faf30-df73-453c-bddf-8d383f699162|Courage]].'
